{
  "id": "PRO.9",
  "number": "9",
  "bookId": "PRO",
  "reference": "Proverbs 9",
  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wisdom has built her house and made seven pillars for it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She has had an animal killed for a feast, mixed spices in the wine, and laid the table. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She has sent her servant women to call out from the highest place in the town: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Come in, ignorant people!” And to the foolish she says, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Come, eat my food and drink the wine that I have mixed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leave the company of ignorant people, and live. Follow the way of knowledge.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you correct conceited people, you will only be insulted. If you reprimand evil people, you will only get hurt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Never correct conceited people; they will hate you for it. But if you correct the wise, they will respect you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anything you say to the wise will make them wiser. Whatever you tell the righteous will add to their knowledge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.28.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Job 28.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.111.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ps 111.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.1.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Prov 1.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To be wise you must first have reverence for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". If you know the Holy One, you have understanding. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wisdom will add years to your life. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You are the one who will profit if you have wisdom, and if you reject it, you are the one who will suffer.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Stupidity is like a loud, ignorant, shameless woman.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9.13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Verse 13 in Hebrew is unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She sits at the door of her house or on a seat in the highest part of the town, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and calls out to people passing by, who are minding their own business: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Come in, ignorant people!” To the foolish she says, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Stolen water is sweeter. Stolen bread tastes better.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Her victims do not know that the people die who go to her house, that those who have already entered are now deep in the world of the dead.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
